## SQ-IPO-01
@group A
@commands Boot; grep latest.log for `ImmersivePosts`, `Mixin`, `immersiveposts`; `/setblock ~ ~ ~ immersiveposts:ironpost`, then `immersiveposts:silverpost`
@pass Both mixins apply, no error; the iron post places; `silverpost` is an unknown block. State count (the pack's state dump, or `Block.BLOCK_STATE_REGISTRY` size) is about 44,900 lower than 770,959
@fails A mixin did not apply: the static-init lambda is no longer `lambda$static$0` (mod updated)
@reviewed 2026-11-16
bootreject (?i)(Mixin apply failed|InvalidInjectionException).*ImmersivePosts
bootreject (?i)immersiveposts.*(exception|error)
> forceload add 2696 2696 2720 2720
> setblock 2700 -60 2700 immersiveposts:ironpost
> setblock 2702 -60 2700 immersiveposts:silverpost
> cdevtest states
capture STN verb=states states=(\d+)
shell python3 -c "import sys; n={STN}; print('states', n, 'cut', 770959 - n); sys.exit(0 if 770959 - n > 40000 else 1)"
expect Changed the block at 2700, -60, 2700
expect (?i)unknown block.*immersiveposts:silverpost
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
## SQ-IPO-02
@group A
@commands Place a post base; use an iron fence on it 3 times; use a hammer on the post's side to make an arm; place a second post 3 blocks away and join them with a truss (fence on the post side)
@pass Post grows, arm and truss form as before
@fails A kept material lost its post or truss: `Posts.get` returned null, check `ImmersivePostsMaterials.KEPT`
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> forceload add 2696 2696 2720 2720
> setblock 2704 -60 2704 immersiveposts:postbase
> cdevtest use 2704 -60 2704 held=immersiveposts:fence_iron hand=main
> cdevtest use 2704 -60 2704 held=immersiveposts:fence_iron hand=main
> cdevtest use 2704 -60 2704 held=immersiveposts:fence_iron hand=main
> setblock 2708 -60 2704 immersiveposts:postbase
> cdevtest use 2708 -60 2704 held=immersiveposts:fence_iron hand=main
> cdevtest use 2708 -60 2704 held=immersiveposts:fence_iron hand=main
> cdevtest use 2708 -60 2704 held=immersiveposts:fence_iron hand=main
> cdevtest count 2704 -59 2704 2704 -55 2704 immersiveposts:ironpost
> cdevtest use 2704 -58 2704 held=immersiveengineering:hammer face=east hand=main
> cdevtest state 2705 -58 2704
> cdevtest use 2704 -57 2704 held=immersiveposts:fence_iron face=east hand=main
> cdevtest state 2706 -57 2704
expect verb=count block=immersiveposts:ironpost n=3\b
reject (?i)exception
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
look the 2705 -58 state is the arm; the truss blocks between the posts at y -57 (state lines; ids per the IP jar); post growth: each fence use raised the post by one
## SQ-IPO-03
@group A
@commands Use a silver fence, a gold fence and a nether brick fence on a post base
@pass Nothing happens (fence places as a normal block or the click is ignored), no exception in the log
@fails Exception from `getPostState`: `isValidItem` was not redirected at that call site
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> forceload add 2696 2696 2720 2720
> setblock 2712 -60 2704 immersiveposts:postbase
> cdevtest use 2712 -60 2704 held=immersiveposts:fence_silver hand=main
> cdevtest use 2712 -60 2704 held=immersiveposts:fence_gold hand=main
> cdevtest use 2712 -60 2704 held=minecraft:nether_brick_fence hand=main
> cdevtest state 2712 -59 2704
reject verb=state pos=2712,-59,2704 state="?immersiveposts:
reject (?i)exception
reject \[cdevtest\] .*done=0
