@@text
@@text Results 2026-10-27 night (`tools/immersive_posts_probe/ipo_probe.js`, `/ipotest`): first the 17:47 jar's `ImmersivePostsValidItemMixin` crashed at load (static handler, `method = "*"`): fixed. SQ-IPO-01 PASS: 726,031 states (-44,928), kept posts and trusses registered, dropped ones not, `setblock ... silverpost` = unknown block; but the mod's own `mineable/pickaxe`, `needs_stone_tool`, `needs_iron_tool` files then failed to load (and IE's `mineable/drill`): fixed with `TagLoaderImmersivePostsMixin`, no IPO tag error after (perf.md 12.2). SQ-IPO-02 partial: an iron fence grows the post 3 times; arms and trusses are hammer paths the mixin does not touch and the fake-player clicks did not form them (player check left: hammer arm, truss). SQ-IPO-03 PASS: silver, gold and nether brick fences place as plain fences, no exception.
